Z||000006||Haze_Performance||02-06-2001||03:04 PM||||  <IMG SRC="http://www.thefieroshop.com/catalog/glovebox.gif">  <P>Hey Mike,<BR>   Thats the Fiero Shops kit. I just called them and ordered it. (416) 747-5728. It used to be a 4 peice kit, now its a 7 peice kit. (Glovebox cover not included) But still VERY COOL!!!! Its polished stainless.<P>Cost: $175.00....  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>WS6 Fieros "Members Photo Page"</A>||||reg||14
