Z||000020||Haze_Performance||02-08-2001||10:43 AM||||Well now that I found all the parts I need to do the interior, All I need to do is have the steering column (upper cover) chrome plated. Ill look into all your ideas that were posted earlier but if anyone else comes up with one please post it.<P>Also has anyone used one of those do it your self plating machines? Im thinking of picking one up. I still have to do some under hood parts & engine stuff.  <P>TFTS  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Carl <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>WS6 Fieros "Members Photo Page"</A>||||reg||14
